      "teaching_points": {"zh": ["SQS 是队列，不是处理器。", "两只 Lambda 是同一张实体卡上的两个角色，必须松开后再按第二次。"], "en": ["SQS is a queue, not a processor.", "The two Lambdas are two roles on the same physical card. Release the key before the second press."]}
